{{!
    @template local_nextpool/item_page

    Editorial view of a catalogue item: header with type, title, status and key facts, then the
    description and versions beside the further details, authors and competencies. The item facts (update mode,
    storage location, availability, licence, last change) and the technical details sit in the card of the
    latest version, or under the heading "Versions" while there is none (task165).

    Values passed as HTML (triple braces) are produced by the renderable through
    format_string(), format_text(), s() or core renderers.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - string HTML, item title
    * typename - string, content type
    * typeicon - string HTML, decorative activity icon
    * status - string, item status name
    * statusclass - string, badge classes
    * statusicon - string HTML, decorative status icon as in status::badge() (task166)
    * statusnotice - string, notice when a version is published but the item is not (task104), '' without
    * statusnoticeaction - string HTML, icon button with the item step for the notice, '' without
    * chips - array of {icon (HTML), label, value (HTML)}, read-only key facts the item has
    * hasdescription - bool
    * description - string HTML
    * latestversionnotice - review-state message and optional rejection reason for the newest numbered version
    * actions - string HTML, "Import new version" and at most one labelled button for the next step
    * iconactions - string HTML, icon actions and the "More actions" menu
    * iconfacts - array of {icon (HTML), label, description}, icon-only facts, see local_nextpool/item_facts
    * facts - array of {icon (HTML), short, full}, read-only pills, see local_nextpool/item_facts
    * technical - array of {label, value (HTML)}, shown on request
    * factsinversion - bool, the facts sit in the card of the latest version (versions.showfacts)
    * hasmetadata - bool
    * metadata - array of {label, value (HTML)}, further details, only filled fields (tags, audience, origin, custom fields)
    * hasauthors - bool
    * authors - array of {name (HTML), hasrole, role (HTML)}
    * showeditors - bool, section "Item editors" shown (editors exist or the user may add them)
    * haseditors - bool
    * editors - array of {name (HTML), remove (HTML icon button, '' without the right)}
    * addeditorurl - string, page to add an item editor, '' without the right
    * hascompetencies - bool
    * competencies - array of {name (HTML), idnumber (HTML), level, function, notice, hasobjectives, objectives}
    * competencies.objectives - array of {id (HTML), bloom, text (HTML)}
    * sourcemissing - string, notice that the file is no longer found in the storage location, '' if found
    * hasversions - bool
    * versioncount - int
    * versions - array of {heading, label, status, statusclass, statusicon (HTML), iscurrent, fileicon, filename,
                  filesize, sourceref,
                  created (tooltip), createdicon, createdprefix, createdname (HTML), createddate, createdfulldate,
                  published (tooltip), publishedicon, publishedname (HTML), publisheddate, publishedfulldate,
                  compareurl, comparelabel, compareicon (HTML), changelog (HTML), changelogshort, changeloglong,
                  h5plibraryhint (HTML), actions (HTML icon group), showfacts}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Fire safety basics",
        "typename": "File (video, PDF, document)",
        "typeicon": "",
        "status": "In review",
        "statusclass": "bg-warning text-dark",
        "statusicon": "",
        "statusnotice": "Version 1 is published, but the item is not.",
        "statusnoticeaction": "",
        "chips": [{"icon": "", "label": "Current version", "value": "V1"}],
        "hasdescription": true,
        "description": "<p>Basics of fire safety at work.</p>",
        "actions": "<button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Import new version</button>",
        "iconactions": "<a class=\"btn btn-icon\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Edit\">E</a>",
        "iconfacts": [
            {
                "icon": "",
                "label": "Updates in courses: Direct",
                "description": "Updates in courses: In place (learner progress is kept)"
            },
            {"icon": "", "label": "Licence: All rights reserved", "description": "Licence: All rights reserved"}
        ],
        "facts": [{"icon": "", "short": "Library", "full": "Storage location: Library"}],
        "technical": [{"label": "Identifier", "value": "0f8c4b1e"}],
        "factsinversion": true,
        "hasmetadata": true,
        "metadata": [{"label": "Audience", "value": "New staff"}],
        "hasauthors": true,
        "authors": [{"name": "Jane Doe", "hasrole": true, "role": "Editor"}],
        "showeditors": true,
        "haseditors": true,
        "editors": [{"name": "Sam Chen", "remove": ""}],
        "addeditorurl": "",
        "hascompetencies": true,
        "competencies": [{
            "name": "Recognise fire hazards",
            "idnumber": "SAFE-01",
            "level": "2 – Guided application",
            "function": "Explain",
            "notice": "",
            "hasobjectives": true,
            "objectives": [{"id": "SAFE-01.1", "bloom": "Understand", "text": "Name the three sources of ignition"}]
        }],
        "sourcemissing": "",
        "hasversions": true,
        "versioncount": 1,
        "versions": [{
            "heading": "Version 1",
            "label": "Initial",
            "status": "Published",
            "statusclass": "bg-success",
            "statusicon": "",
            "iscurrent": true,
            "fileicon": "",
            "filename": "handout.pdf",
            "filesize": "120 KB",
            "sourceref": "Safety/handout.pdf",
            "created": "Created by Admin User on 2/10/26, 10:00",
            "createdicon": "",
            "createdprefix": "Created by",
            "createdname": "Admin User",
            "createddate": "02/10/26",
            "createdfulldate": "2/10/26, 10:00",
            "published": "published by Admin User on 2/10/26, 11:00",
            "publishedicon": "",
            "publishedname": "Admin User",
            "publisheddate": "02/10/26",
            "publishedfulldate": "2/10/26, 11:00",
            "compareurl": "",
            "comparelabel": "",
            "compareicon": "",
            "changelog": "<p>First release</p>",
            "changelogshort": "First release",
            "changeloglong": false,
            "h5plibraryhint": "",
            "actions": "<div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Actions: Version 1\"></div>",
            "showfacts": true
        }]
    }
}}
<div class="local-nextpool-item">
    {{#sourcemissing}}
        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="status">{{sourcemissing}}</div>
    {{/sourcemissing}}
    <div data-tour="itemoverview" class="local-nextpool-item__header d-flex flex-wrap align-items-start gap-3 p-3 mb-3">
        <span class="local-nextpool-item__icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0">{{{typeicon}}}</span>
        <div class="local-nextpool-item__headline flex-grow-1">
            <p class="local-nextpool-item__eyebrow text-uppercase small fw-semibold mb-1">{{typename}}</p>
            <h2 class="h3 mb-2"{{#contentlanguage}} lang="{{contentlanguage}}"{{/contentlanguage}}>{{{title}}}</h2>
            <ul class="list-unstyled d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-0" data-tour="itemsummary" aria-label="{{#str}} itemsummary, local_nextpool {{/str}}">
                <li><span class="badge rounded-pill text-wrap text-start local-nextpool-statuspill {{statusclass}} local-nextpool-item__status"><span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}} status {{/str}}: </span>{{{statusicon}}}{{status}}</span></li>
                {{#chips}}
                    <li class="local-nextpool-chip d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1 small"><span class="visually-hidden">{{label}}: </span>{{{icon}}}{{{value}}}</li>
                {{/chips}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-tour="itemactions" class="local-nextpool-item__iconactions d-flex align-items-center flex-shrink-0">{{{iconactions}}}</div>
        {{#actions}}
            <div class="local-nextpool-item__actions d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 w-100">{{{actions}}}</div>
        {{/actions}}
    </div>
    {{#statusnotice}}
        <div class="alert alert-info d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 py-2 local-nextpool-statusnotice">
            <span>{{statusnotice}}</span>{{{statusnoticeaction}}}
        </div>
    {{/statusnotice}}

    {{#latestversionnotice}}
        <div class="alert {{class}} local-nextpool-versionnotice">
            <p class="mb-0">{{message}}</p>
            {{#reason}}<div class="mt-2">{{{reason}}}</div>{{/reason}}
        </div>
    {{/latestversionnotice}}

    <div class="local-nextpool-item__body d-lg-flex align-items-start">
        <div class="local-nextpool-item__main">
            {{#hasdescription}}
                <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="local-nextpool-description">
                    <h3 class="h5" id="local-nextpool-description">{{#str}} description {{/str}}</h3>
                    <div{{#contentlanguage}} lang="{{contentlanguage}}"{{/contentlanguage}}>{{{description}}}</div>
                </section>
            {{/hasdescription}}

            <section data-tour="itemversions" aria-labelledby="local-nextpool-versions">
                <h3 class="h5" id="local-nextpool-versions">{{#str}} versions, local_nextpool {{/str}}{{#hasversions}} <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">{{versioncount}}</span>{{/hasversions}}</h3>
                {{^hasversions}}
                    <p class="text-muted">{{#str}} noversions, local_nextpool {{/str}}</p>
                {{/hasversions}}
                {{^factsinversion}}
                    <div class="mb-3">{{> local_nextpool/item_facts }}</div>
                {{/factsinversion}}
                {{#versions}}
                    <section class="card local-nextpool-version mb-2">
                        <div class="card-body py-2 px-3">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2">
                                <h4 class="h6 card-title d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 flex-grow-1 mb-1 mt-2">
                                    {{heading}}{{#label}} – {{{label}}}{{/label}}
                                    <span class="badge rounded-pill text-wrap text-start local-nextpool-statuspill {{statusclass}}">{{{statusicon}}}{{status}}</span>
                                    {{#iscurrent}}<span class="local-nextpool-current" title="{{#str}} currentversion, local_nextpool {{/str}}">{{#pix}} i/star, core {{/pix}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}} currentversion, local_nextpool {{/str}}</span></span>{{/iscurrent}}
                                </h4>
                                {{{actions}}}
                            </div>
                            <p class="local-nextpool-version__facts d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center column-gap-3 row-gap-1 mb-1 small text-break">
                                <span title="{{sourceref}}">{{{fileicon}}}{{{filename}}} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {{filesize}}</span>
                                <span title="{{created}}">{{{createdicon}}}{{#createdprefix}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{createdprefix}} </span>{{/createdprefix}}{{{createdname}}} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span aria-hidden="true">{{createddate}}</span><span class="visually-hidden">{{createdfulldate}}</span></span>
                                {{#published}}
                                    <span title="{{published}}">{{{publishedicon}}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}} publishedby_short, local_nextpool {{/str}} </span>{{{publishedname}}} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span aria-hidden="true">{{publisheddate}}</span><span class="visually-hidden">{{publishedfulldate}}</span></span>
                                {{/published}}
                                {{#compareurl}}
                                    <a class="d-inline-block py-1" href="{{compareurl}}">{{{compareicon}}}{{comparelabel}}</a>
                                {{/compareurl}}
                            </p>
                            {{#changelog}}
                                {{#changeloglong}}
                                    <details class="small text-muted mb-1">
                                        <summary>{{changelogshort}}</summary>
                                        <div class="mt-1">{{{changelog}}}</div>
                                    </details>
                                {{/changeloglong}}
                                {{^changeloglong}}
                                    <p class="small text-muted mb-1">{{changelogshort}}</p>
                                {{/changeloglong}}
                            {{/changelog}}
                            {{#h5plibraryhint}}
                                <div class="alert alert-info mt-1 mb-1">{{{h5plibraryhint}}}</div>
                            {{/h5plibraryhint}}
                            {{#showfacts}}
                                {{> local_nextpool/item_facts }}
                            {{/showfacts}}
                        </div>
                    </section>
                {{/versions}}
            </section>
        </div>

        <div class="local-nextpool-item__aside">
            {{#hasmetadata}}
                <section class="local-nextpool-panel p-3 mb-3" aria-labelledby="local-nextpool-details">
                    <h3 class="h5" id="local-nextpool-details">{{#str}} itemdetails, local_nextpool {{/str}}</h3>
                    <dl class="local-nextpool-details mb-0">
                        {{#metadata}}
                            <dt class="small text-muted fw-normal">{{label}}</dt>
                            <dd class="mb-2">{{{value}}}</dd>
                        {{/metadata}}
                    </dl>
                </section>
            {{/hasmetadata}}

            {{#hasauthors}}
                <section class="local-nextpool-panel p-3 mb-3" aria-labelledby="local-nextpool-authors">
                    <h3 class="h5" id="local-nextpool-authors">{{#str}} authors, local_nextpool {{/str}}</h3>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                        {{#authors}}
                            <li>{{{name}}}{{#hasrole}} <span class="text-muted">({{{role}}})</span>{{/hasrole}}</li>
                        {{/authors}}
                    </ul>
                </section>
            {{/hasauthors}}

            {{#showeditors}}
                <section class="local-nextpool-panel local-nextpool-editors p-3 mb-3" aria-labelledby="local-nextpool-editors">
                    <h3 class="h5" id="local-nextpool-editors">{{#str}} itemeditors, local_nextpool {{/str}}</h3>
                    {{^haseditors}}<p class="text-muted small">{{#str}} itemeditorsnone, local_nextpool {{/str}}</p>{{/haseditors}}
                    {{#haseditors}}
                        <ul class="list-unstyled mb-2">
                            {{#editors}}
                                <li class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">{{{name}}}{{{remove}}}</li>
                            {{/editors}}
                        </ul>
                    {{/haseditors}}
                    {{#addeditorurl}}
                        <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="{{addeditorurl}}">{{#str}} itemeditoradd, local_nextpool {{/str}}</a>
                    {{/addeditorurl}}
                </section>
            {{/showeditors}}

            {{#hascompetencies}}
                <section class="local-nextpool-panel p-3" aria-labelledby="local-nextpool-competencies">
                    <h3 class="h5" id="local-nextpool-competencies">{{#str}} competencies, local_nextpool {{/str}}</h3>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 local-nextpool-competencies">
                        {{#competencies}}
                            <li class="mb-2">
                                <strong>{{{name}}}</strong> <span class="text-muted">({{{idnumber}}})</span>
                                <div class="small">{{level}} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {{function}}</div>
                                {{#notice}}
                                    <div class="alert alert-warning py-1 px-2 my-1 small">{{notice}}</div>
                                {{/notice}}
                                {{#hasobjectives}}
                                    <ul class="small mb-0">
                                        {{#objectives}}
                                            <li>{{#bloom}}<span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">{{bloom}}</span> {{/bloom}}{{{text}}}{{#id}} <span class="text-muted">({{{id}}})</span>{{/id}}</li>
                                        {{/objectives}}
                                    </ul>
                                {{/hasobjectives}}
                            </li>
                        {{/competencies}}
                    </ul>
                </section>
            {{/hascompetencies}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
